DD`, `CVDD`, `DVDD`, `TSREF`, `LDOIN`, `NEG5V`.\\n\\nAccording to BFS-DC, I should start with the structural anchors. U1 is the most central component.\\n\\nI\'ll create the file `/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/output/bq79616_eval_board.tsx`.\\n"}'}}, {'id': 'call_3887e00babd14599abe1ab649451', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'file_editor', 'arguments': '{"file_text": "import { BQ79616PAPR } from \\"./lib/BQ79616PAPR\\"\\n\\nexport default () => {\\n  return (\\n    <board width=\\"200mm\\" height=\\"150mm\\">\\n      <net name=\\"GND\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"PWR\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"AVDD\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"CVDD\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"DVDD\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"TSREF\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"LDOIN\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"NEG5V\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"NPNB\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"REFHP\\" />\\n\\n      <BQ79616PAPR name=\\"U1\\" />\\n\\n      {/* Ground connections for U1 */}\\n      <trace from=\\".U1 > .AVSS\\" to=\\"net.GND\\" />\\n      <trace from=\\".U1 > .CVSS\\" to=\\"net.GND\\" />\\n      <trace from=\\".U1 > .DVSS\\" to=\\"net.GND\\" />\\n      <trace from=\\".U1 > .REFHM\\" to=\\"net.GND\\" />\\n      <trace from=\\".U1 > .EP\\" to=\\"net.GND\\" />\\n\\n    </board>\\n  )\\n}\\n", "security_risk": "LOW", "path": "/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/output/bq79616_eval_board.tsx", "command": "create"}'}}]}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Your thought has been logged.'}], 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_c6c5a0d2658143efa4325d0288b5', 'name': 'think'}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'File created successfully at: /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/output/bq79616_eval_board.tsx'}], 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_3887e00babd14599abe1ab649451', 'name': 'file_editor'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_adba87e49bd6480f88b55bf30440', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'file_editor', 'arguments': '{"security_risk": "LOW", "command": "view", "path": "/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/resources/schematic_images/subckt_pow_supply.png"}'}}]}, {'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Image file /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/resources/schematic_images/subckt_pow_supply.png read successfully. Displaying image content.'}, {'type': 'image_url', 'image_url': {'url': 'data:image/png;base64,'}}], 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_adba87e49bd6480f88b55bf30440', 'name': 'file_editor'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_9433fbedbae948a68b1165cd8d26', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'think', 'arguments': '{"thought": "I will now add the power supply components: Q1, R3, R4, R5, C1, C2, C3, C5, C6, C7, C8, C9, C59.\\nI\'ll also add the LED D1 and its resistor R121.\\n\\nFrom SCUD:\\n- R5 (30.0Ω), C5 (10nF) on `BAT` pin.\\n- Q1 Collector via R4 (200Ω) and R3 (100Ω) from `PWR`.\\n- C1 (0.22μF) on Q1 Collector.\\n- Q1 Emitter to `LDOIN`.\\n- Q1 Base to `NPNB`.\\n- AVDD: C6 (1μF)\\n- CVDD: C9 (1μF)\\n- DVDD: C7 (4.7μF), C8 (1μF)\\n- LDOIN: C59 (0.1μF)\\n- NEG5V: C3 (0.1μF)\\n- TSREF: C2 (1μF)\\n- D1 (LED) with R121 (1.0k) and J6.\\n\\nI need to check the pinout for MMBT3904LT1G (Q1).\\nFrom component_pin_mapping.md:\\nMMBT3904LT1G: pin1: pin1, pin2: pin2, pin3: pin3.\\nWait, usually for SOT-23 MMBT3904: 1=Base, 2=Emitter, 3=Collector.\\nLet me check the schematic image `subckt_pow_supply.png` to be sure about Q1 pins if possible, or assume standard SOT-23 if not specified.\\nActually, the mapping says pin1, pin2, pin3. I should check if there\'s more info or just use them.\\nLooking at `subckt_pow_supply.png`...\\nQ1 is MMBT3904.\\nPin 1 is Base (connected to NPNB).\\nPin 2 is Emitter (connected to LDOIN).\\nPin 3 is Collector (connected to R3).\\nThis matches standard SOT-23.\\n\\nWait, I should also check the LED D1 pins.\\n150060GS75000: pin1: K, pin2: A.\\n\\nI\'ll add the