                             (J17-3)\\n\\nPin mapping for ISO7342FCQDWRQ1:\\n- pin1: VCC1\\n- pin2: GND11\\n- pin3: INA\\n- pin4: INB\\n- pin5: OUTC\\n- pin6:                   
