`BBP2`.\\nUsually they are tied together or one is used.\\nIn `subckt_bus_bar.png`, the net `BBP` goes to pin 64.\\nI\'ll check if pin 48 is connected to anything.\\nIn `subckt_bq79616_ic.png`, pin 48 (`BBP1`) seems to be connected to the same net as pin 64 (`BBP2`)?\\nActually, it\'s hard to see. But SCUD says \\"BBP (Pin 64)\\".\\nI\'ll stick with Pin 64.\\n\\nI\'ll add R20 and C12.\\n"}'}}, {'id': 'call_42a5a1c255ee460d83d45a022357', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'file_editor', 'arguments': '{"path": "/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/output/bq79616_eval_board.tsx", "old_str": "      {/* Channels 2-8 */}\\n      {[\\n        { r: \\"R8\\", rt: \\"RT2\\", gpio: \\"GPIO2\\", j_pin: 4, u_pin: \\"GPIO2\\" },\\n        { r: \\"R11\\", rt: \\"RT3\\", gpio: \\"GPIO3\\", j_pin: 6, u_pin: \\"GPIO3\\" },\\n        { r: \\"R14\\", rt: \\"RT4\\", gpio: \\"GPIO4\\", j_pin: 8, u_pin: \\"GPIO4\\" },\\n        { r: \\"R15\\", rt: \\"RT5\\", gpio: \\"GPIO5\\", j_pin: 10, u_pin: \\"GPIO5\\" },\\n        { r: \\"R16\\", rt: \\"RT6\\", gpio: \\"GPIO6\\", j_pin: 12, u_pin: \\"GPIO6\\" },\\n        { r: \\"R18\\", rt: \\"RT7\\", gpio: \\"GPIO7\\", j_pin: 14, u_pin: \\"GPIO7\\" },\\n        { r: \\"R19\\", rt: \\"RT8\\", gpio: \\"GPIO8\\", j_pin: 16, u_pin: \\"GPIO8\\" },\\n      ].map((ch) => (\\n        <group key={ch.gpio}>\\n          <resistor name={ch.r} resistance=\\"10k\\" footprint=\\"0603\\" />\\n          <NCP18XH103F03RB name={ch.rt} />\\n          <trace from=\\"net.PULLUP\\" to={`.${ch.r} > .pin1`} />\\n          <trace from={`.${ch.r} > .pin2`} to={`.${ch.rt} > .pin1`} />\\n          <trace from={`.${ch.rt} > .pin2`} to=\\"net.GND\\" />\\n          <trace from={`.${ch.r} > .pin2`} to={`.J4 > .pin${ch.j_pin}`} />\\n          <trace from={`.J4 > .pin${ch.j_pin - 1}`} to={`.U1 > .${ch.u_pin}`} />\\n        </group>\\n      ))}\\n", "security_risk": "LOW", "new_str": "      {/* Channels 2-8 */}\\n      {[\\n        { r: \\"R8\\", rt: 