 -> `NF_J` -> U2 (IND) -> U2 (OUTD) -> `NFAULT_C` (J17-3)\\n\\nPin mapping for ISO7342FCQDWRQ1:\\n- pin1: VCC1\\n- pin2: GND11\\n- pin3: INA\\n- pin4: INB\\n- pin5: OUTC\\n- pin6: OUTD\\n- pin7: EN1\\n- pin8: GND12\\n- pin9: GND22\\n- pin10: EN2\\n- pin11: IND\\n- pin12: INC\\n- pin13: OUTB\\n- pin14: OUTA\\n- pin15: GND21\\n- pin16: VCC2\\n\\nI\'ll also add the direct UART header J3 and J1.\\n- J3-1: GND\\n- J3-2: NFAULT\\n- J3-3: RX_C\\n- J3-4: TX\\n- J1: Connects `RX_C` to `RX` via R119 (100Ω).\\n\\nWait, SCUD says: `RX` (BMS) can be driven from `RX_C` (J3-3) via R119 (100Ω) and J1.\\nSo: J3-3 -> R119 -> J1 -> RX.\\n\\nI\'ll add these now.\\n"}'}}, {'id': 'call_4271561ca18a457f86dfbceeda22', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'file_editor', 'arguments': '{"command": "insert", "path": "/home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/output/bq79616_eval_board.tsx", "new_str": "\\n      {/* Communication Interface */}\\n      <import { ISO7342FCQDWRQ1 } from \\"./lib/ISO7342FCQDWRQ1\\" />\\n      <ISO7342FCQDWRQ1 name=\\"U2\\" />\\n      <capacitor name=\\"C57\\" capacitance=\\"0.1uF\\" footprint=\\"0603\\" />\\n      <capacitor name=\\"C58\\" capacitance=\\"0.1uF\\" footprint=\\"0603\\" />\\n      <jumper name=\\"J17\\" /> {/* 2x5 Header */}\\n      <jumper name=\\"J18\\" />\\n      <jumper name=\\"J21\\" />\\n      <jumper name=\\"J2\\" />\\n      <jumper name=\\"J1\\" />\\n      <jumper name=\\"J3\\" /> {/* 6-pin Header */}\\n      <resistor name=\\"R119\\" resistance=\\"100\\" footprint=\\"0603\\" />\\n      <resistor name=\\"R123\\" resistance=\\"10k\\" footprint=\\"0603\\" /> {/* INA to GND */}\\n\\n      <net name=\\"USB2ANY_3.3V\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"CVDD_CO\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"RX_CO\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"NF_J\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"RX\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"TX\\" />\\n      <net name=\\"NFAULT\\" />\\n\\n      <trace from=\\".U2 > .VCC1\\" to=\\"net.USB2ANY_3.3V\\" />\\n      <trace from=\\".C57 > .pin1\\" to=\