                             Zener/TVS Diode\\\".\\nLet's check `subckt_gpios.png` for D3.\\nD3 in `subckt_gpios.png` shows two Zeners common anode? Or common                   
                             cathode?\\nActually, BZX84C24 is a single Zener. But SCUD says \\\"Dual Zener/TVS\\\".\\nWait, BZX84C24 is a single Zener in SOT-23                 
                             where pin 3 is Cathode and pin 1 is Anode (pin 2 is NC).\\nLet me check the image.\\nIn `subckt_gpios.png`, D3 is shown as a 3-pin                  
